---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="founder">

  <div class="container founder-grid">

    <!-- Founder Placeholder -->

    <div class="founder-image">

      <div class="founder-placeholder">

        <div class="founder-avatar">
          👩🏾
        </div>

        <h3>Meet Our Founder</h3>

        <p>
          Our founder's portrait and personal story will be shared here soon.
        </p>

        <p class="founder-note">
          Until then, we invite you to discover the vision, heart and purpose
          behind Christian Women Community—and become part of this growing
          sisterhood.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Founder Content -->

    <div class="founder-content">

      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="FROM OUR FOUNDER"
        title="Welcome Home"
        text=""
      />

      <p>
        When God placed Christian Women Community on my heart,
        it wasn't simply to create another women's organisation.
      </p>

      <p>
        It was to build a home.
      </p>

      <p>
        A place where women can encounter Christ deeply,
        discover their God-given purpose,
        build meaningful relationships,
        flourish in every area of life
        and become everything God created them to be.
      </p>

      <p>
        Whether you are seeking spiritual growth,
        genuine sisterhood,
        encouragement,
        opportunities to serve,
        or a place where your gifts can flourish,
        I want you to know that you belong here.
      </p>

      <p>
        My prayer is that every Virtuosa becomes
        stronger in faith,
        richer in purpose,
        and empowered to influence her world for Christ.
      </p>

      <h3>Welcome Home.</h3>

      <div class="signature">

        <strong>Omolade Adeniyi</strong>

        <span>Founder</span>

      </div>

      <a href="/join" class="btn-primary">
        Join Our Community →
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>